morse-halow (1.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial metapackage: version-locked Morse HaLow stack for the
    Wio-WM6108 module (Quectel FGH100M-H).
  * Pins morse-fgh100m-dkms (= 1.16.4-3), morse-firmware (= 20251207-1),
    hostapd-morse-tools (= 1.0-1), wpa-supplicant-morse-tools (= 1.0-1)
    and morsectrl-tools (= 1.0-1).
  * The image build (recomputer-rk35xx-common.inc SEEED_MORSE_ENABLE)
    installs this single package; exact (=) pins keep driver, firmware
    and userspace tools upgrading in lockstep.
  * The driver deliberately carries no Depends on morse-firmware:
    image builds still running the previous .inc bake the firmware
    into armbian-bsp-cli and install it AFTER the Seeed packages
    (install_distribution_agnostic follows install_distribution_
    specific) with no reverse Replaces, so that edge would abort those
    builds on a dpkg file conflict. Driver/firmware coupling lives in
    this metapackage only.

 -- Seeed Studio <techsupport@seeed.cc>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0800
